of finding evidence as to the cause of the young pharaoh's death. X-rays, however, show a young man

00:41:48.190 --> 00:41:54.530
in good health, and unless there is evidence still to be discovered, the reason for Tut's early death

00:41:54.530 --> 00:41:56.820
may remain forever a mystery.

00:42:09.120 --> 00:42:15.860
Sound, like light or heat or x-rays, radiates all around us in the form of vibrating waves.

00:42:19.350 --> 00:42:22.650
This image of a human hand was made with high-frequency sound.

00:42:25.220 --> 00:42:29.970
Using this technique, doctors can now see soft internal tissue that was...

